OL,3,GNEWSAFire-hit nature reserve 'will
OL,4,Anever be the same'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nature reserve has said the wildlife
OL,7,F"will never really be the same again"
OL,8,Fafter a huge wildfire almost three
OL,9,Fmonths ago.
OL,11,FThe blaze, which broke out on 29 July,
OL,12,Fstarted on the edge of RSPB Minsmere
OL,13,Fbefore it spread to neighbouring
OL,14,FDunwich Heath on the Suffolk coast.
OL,16,FFirefighters have been unable to
OL,17,Fdetermine the cause.
OL,19,FIan Barthorpe, visitor experience
OL,20,Fofficer at Minsmere, said the team was
OL,21,Fconcerned about the long-term
OL,22,Fimplications the fire.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
